  abilityId: 860288
  abilityName: Gravitational Crusher
  abilityDesc: 17 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP,
    boosts own critical rate), boosts Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate (Dark) for
    3 turns, damage taken may restore HP for 3 turns, fills BB gauge for 3 turns,
    probable evasion for 2 turns & fills OD gauge
